"name":"Andrei Demchenko"},{"id":2791333,"name":"Roman Senkov"},{"id":1947736,"name":"Mikhail Gorskiy","role":"Viktor Gorbatko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1AlR95AS51RCK8t059bcld1u0jZ.jpg"},{"id":2372849,"name":"Anton Toropov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bnF7ku3GhCGAWsgk7sJVueTQ8ey.jpg"},{"id":3360594,"name":"Dmitriy Maltsev","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9PqOIZgGQlpzEBg5XTyMShfSKPB.jpg"},{"id":2271474,"name":"Oliviya Yakovtseva","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4gcxsq7cAE3BzEuo5FFs0cRgPak.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Gagarin - Primo nello spazio","overview":"Il 12 aprile 1961 il cosmonauta sovietico Yuri Gagarin decolla con un razzo Vostok alla volta dello spazio, diventando il primo uomo a orbitare intorno alla Terra per 108 minuti. Il primo gruppo di cosmonauti è stato selezionato tra tremila piloti di caccia di tutta l'Urss e nessuno dei venti sapeva che uno di loro avrebbe avuto a che fare con qualcosa di più della gravità del pianeta.","tagline":"L'incredibile avventura del primo uomo che vide il pianeta blu dal cielo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Gagarin: First in Space","overview":"The film is dedicated to the first steps of mankind on the path of space exploration and direct the fate of the first cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin. The main motif - the fight for the right to be first: the competition in the first cosmonaut, competition in missile technology, the confrontation of superpowers - the USSR and the USA.  In the first group of astronauts were selected from three thousand fighter pilots across the country. In twenty of the legendary got the best of the best. Which of them will fly first, no one knew. In this way, had to contend not only with the pull of the earth ..."},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Фильм посвящен первым шагам человечества на пути освоения космоса и непосредственно судьбе первого космонавта Ю. А. Гагарина. Основной лейтмотив - борьба за право быть первым: соревнование в первом отряде космонавтов; конкуренция технологий в ракетостроении; противостояние сверхдержав - СССР и США.  В первый отряд космонавтов отбирали из трёх тысяч летчиков-истребителей по всей стране. В легендарную двадцатку попали лучшие из лучших. Кто из них полетит первым, не знал никто. На этом пути пришлось бороться не только с земным притяжением…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ecLB1prHPCN4MGO2MoFQ3hyxVQu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ecLB1prHPCN4MGO2MoFQ3hyxVQu.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gYSJ1gFn106hq8z4nxpuWuMDWkO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gYSJ1gFn106hq8z4nxpuWuMDWkO.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rRo5OglUeF1m7N0osa6FoPXJWMA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rRo5OglUeF1m7N0osa6FoPXJWMA.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nTk9rVyHIq89SgvEs91jzxq51ou.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nTk9rVyHIq89SgvEs91jzxq51ou.jpg","language":"en","width":760,"height":1065},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9mMtGCmQGY2vmfPE2Gzxpmuj1a.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i9mMtGCmQGY2vmfPE2Gzxpmuj1a.jpg","language":"en","width":1253,"height":1771},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/825astfdGMi6njiskQZcjFwbytY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/825astfdGMi6njiskQZcjFwbytY.jpg","language":"ru","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hV2TytMYvduusLFnk1Y8N16n2ok.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hV2TytMYvduusLFnk1Y8N16n2ok.jpg","language":"xx","width":1417,"height":797},{"type